IC2 materials and reference

The original IC2 textures, visual assets and sound effects reused by this
project remain the property of the official IndustrialCraft 2 (IC2) project
and their respective original copyright holders. IndustrialCraft2-CE does
not claim ownership of these materials.

IndustrialCraft2-CE is an independent reimplementation, rewritten with the
original IC2 source code used as a reference for gameplay behavior and
compatibility. This reference-based rewrite does not transfer copyright in
the original IC2 code or reused materials.

The upstream IndustrialCraft 2 input declares "All rights reserved" in its
META-INF/mods.toml. Original code, assets, sound effects, names and other
materials retain their respective copyright and licensing terms. Original
copyright notices and author credits are retained. This project does not
grant additional rights to upstream materials or replace their licenses.

The MIT License for project code does not apply to original IC2 code,
textures, visual assets, sound effects or other upstream materials.
Third-party components retain their own notices and licenses. See NOTICE and
the licenses directory.
